            <!-- Online payment -->
            <br />
            <h4>Online Payments</h4>
            <p>
              Tuition is paid through FACTS, our online payment processor. A
              tuition plan must be selected during online enrollment. Three plan
              options are available for tuition payments: one payment, two
              payments or nine monthly payments. Families that choose monthly
              installments are assessed a $30 annual fee.
            </p>
            <p class="cotw-link--mb-small">
